    {
      "id": "3",
      "subevent": "The itinerary will be released later, taking into consideration the evolution of the worldwide health emergency."
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "subevent": "Pope Francis has long expressed his desire to visit Iraq, having told a meeting of Catholic aid agencies on 10 June 2019 that he planned to travel there in 2020."
