      "id": "8",
      "subevent": "Christians' presence in Iraq has drastically diminished from 1-1.4 million before 2003 to 300-400 thousand after war and IS occupation."
    },
    {
      "id": "9",
      "subevent": "Iraq's president and prime minister have often invited Christians who fled to return and help rebuild the nation."
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "subevent": "Recovery has been impeded by economic crisis, corruption, and 1.7 million internally displaced people, with UNICEF estimating 4 million Iraqis requiring assistance."
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "subevent": "Cardinal Sako says Pope Francis' visit will bring a breath of fresh hope to the long-suffering nation."
    }
  ]
